      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 1 — Oneiric Reservoir.</strong> Your Clarity maximum is +2. On Soma Break you recover Clarity equal to your tier instead of the flat default. Detect Spark resonance in adjacent hexes (carryover).</p>\n<p style=\"opacity:0.7;font-size:0.85em\">Discipline (passive): Clarity max +2.</p>\n<p style=\"opacity:0.7;font-size:0.85em\">Skill rank +1 in Perception and Faith.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"dwT1\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Oneiric Reservoir</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> Passive &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> — &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Clarity max +2. On Soma Break recover Clarity equal to your tier (instead of flat default). Detect Spark resonance in adjacent hexes (carryover).</div>\n</div>",
